# A ModusToolbox application may contain exactly one PSA Crypto
# implementation. This application uses ifx-tf-psa-crypto, built by the
# ifx-tf-psa-port library, so the copy of TF-PSA-Crypto that is bundled inside
# the Mbed TLS 4.x checkout must stay out of the build. Otherwise every
# psa_* symbol is defined twice at link time.
$(SEARCH_mbedtls)/tf-psa-crypto
